  "description": "A son who accompanies his old father, who spends the rest of his life in a nursing home, to an outpatient clinic at the hospital once a month. The outpatient clinic is the only time he goes out and is a time for short, awkward conversations between father and son. The son tries to reconcile psychologically with his father by retracing the past and present together. And the son's children, a hidden story of three generations.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
